Upstream attribution

SivaSafe is derived from MARK XLVI by FatihMakes
(https://github.com/FatihMakes/Mark-XLVI), licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0.
Changes were made: SivaSafe adapts and substantially extends that project for
older adults.

The face-detection (YuNet) and face-recognition (SFace) models bundled in
config/models/ come from the OpenCV Model Zoo
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo) and remain under their original licenses.
